# Edit scope — web only

- Make all code changes in `web/` (production Next.js app).
- Do **not** edit `design/` unless the user explicitly asks to change the design prototype.
- When porting or syncing behavior, implement in `web/` only — do not mirror changes into `design/main/` by default.
- `assets/` and docs are still fair game when relevant; this restriction targets `design/`.
